    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Initially, it is important to check the Referee Reports."
      ],
      "justification": "Implicit start and first action align perfectly with the opening instruction."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "guard:b1->n17",
        "action:n17"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they have been completed, you can proceed with the process. However, if they have not been completed"
      ],
      "justification": "XOR split and guards faithfully represent the completion condition and its two outcomes, including the immediate proceed path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "flag it and send a reminder"
      ],
      "justification": "Direct restatement of the negative outcome action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "continue to monitor if the Referee Reports have been completed",
        "After that, you should check again if the Referee Reports have been completed."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures both the monitoring instruction and the explicit re-check step as a single consolidated action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n16",
        "guard:b2->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they have, you can continue with the process. If not, you should flag it again and send another reminder."
      ],
      "justification": "Second decision point and guards match the re-evaluation condition and branches."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n16"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "flag it again and send another reminder"
      ],
      "justification": "Exact match for the repeated failure action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the Referee Reports have been completed, you can move on to organizing interviews for the Selection Panel with the top candidates."
      ],
      "justification": "Implicit join point and subsequent action align with advancing to interviews."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After the interviews, it is necessary to receive feedback from the interview candidates."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact alignment with feedback collection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->b4",
        "guard:b3->c2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, you need to check if a Psychometric Test is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Decision node and guards correctly model the requirement check and its routing."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "branch:b4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it is, you should then check if an HR Specialist is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Nested decision node matches the secondary requirement check."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->n11",
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If an HR Specialist is required, you should schedule the test with a third party."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard and action together faithfully execute the scheduling condition and step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->n12",
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Otherwise, you can proceed to complete the Psychometric Test."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard and action together faithfully execute the alternative completion step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If not, you can continue with the process and coordinate the second round of selection."
      ],
      "justification": "Join point consolidates all test-related paths before proceeding to coordinate the second round."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n14"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, you should request the final candidate ranking and continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact match for the final ranking request step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "end:e1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, you should request the final candidate ranking and continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Implicit termination following the final described step."
    }
